.TH SDL_GPUShader 3type "SDL 3.5.0" "Simple Directmedia Layer" "SDL3 DATATYPES"
.SH NAME
SDL_GPUShader \- An opaque handle representing a compiled shader object.
.SH SYNOPSIS
